{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object in sight, approach and if able, take it. Process it. If not, scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Condition ID = ObjectIsTouchable    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInSight    /> <Condition ID = NoObjectsFound    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    />\"",
